@0    = ~Eh?  <CHARNAME> what is this? What's going on?~
@1    = ~It's good to see you again, Nina.~
@2    = ~It is nice to see you again as well my friend.~
@3    = ~It's good to have you back! I need help once again from you.~
@4    = ~You don't seem very surprised to be here.~
@5    = ~It is good to be back! I will endeavor to serve and help you whenever I can. Shall we go?~
@6    = ~Sounds good. Let's go.~
@7    = ~Alright...wait here awhile and I'll deal with you later.~
@8    = ~Why would I be surprised?  If you need a good sword arm who can cast spells you know I am your lady for that task.~
@9    = ~Let's go, Nina.~
@10   = ~Just wait here and I'll deal with you later.~
@11   = ~Very well. I shall wait until you wish me to rejoin again.~
@12   = ~Yes? Do you wish me to join up?~
@13   = ~Yes let's go.~
@14   = ~Wait here for awhile longer.~
@15   = ~Good, good! I will be here then.~
